# Used by the api image's build (docker-compose.*.yml's api service now
# builds from this repo root, not api/, so it can COPY front/src -- see
# api/Dockerfile.prod/.dev and api/src/recordPresentation.js's own import of
# front/src/matchOverrides.js and customRankings.js). Only api/ and
# front/src/ are ever referenced by a COPY instruction; everything below is
# either huge, irrelevant to that build, or sensitive, and would otherwise
# get tarred into the build context sent to the Docker daemon on every
# build. front's own image still builds with context: front/ (its own
# front/.dockerignore applies there, unaffected by this file).
.git
.github
.idea
.dockerignore
.DS_Store
.env
.env.example
node_modules
**/node_modules
front/dist
mongodb
redis-dump.rdb
redis.conf
db-dump
scimagojr-data
analytics
anubis
monitoring
reverse-proxy
scripts
ops
HANDOFF_CROSSCHECK.md
README.md
